config ANDROID_WRAPFD
	bool "WrapFD Driver (Rust)"
	depends on RUST && MMU && 64BIT
	help
	  Enables the Rust implementation of the WrapFD driver to control
          ability to map a file.

	  WrapFD allows wrapping an fd representing a memory buffer into a new
	  file supporting ioctl API for file ownership that controls ability to
	  map the file.

config ANDROID_RUST_WRAPFD_KUNIT_TEST
	tristate "KUnit test for Rust wrapfd driver" if !KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	depends on KUNIT
	depends on ANDROID_WRAPFD
	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	help
	  This builds the Rust wrapfd driver unit test.
	  Tests the Rust wrapfd driver functionality.
	  For more information on KUnit and unit tests in general please refer
	  to the KUnit documentation in Documentation/dev-tools/kunit/.

	  If unsure, say N.
